♪ <i>No way, no how</i>
<i>I'ma turn around</i> ♪

2365
01:35:08.943 --> 01:35:11.412
♪ <i>See the good in the bad</i>
<i>Life handed me</i> ♪

2366
01:35:11.546 --> 01:35:14.248
♪ <i>The broken road that led me</i>
